    "Casey's Q5 answer (PR #66 comment 6968763406, item 2), as PR #67 words it in lnk_01: a NeighborInfo pair resolves the relay byte \"when the gateway's own NeighborInfo reports in the same 24 hours list exactly one neighbour with that low byte, counted across all of those reports together\".",
