    "10:10, relay 113: the reports together list two neighbours with 113, c49-n1 and c49-n2, so NeighborInfo resolves nothing: dropped by lnk_01. Read one report at a time, each would resolve, to a different node.",
    "10:20, relay 114: the reports together list one neighbour with 114, c49-ra, named in both; one node named twice is one neighbour. Relayer c49-ra, link_source neighbor_info.",
    "c49-ra is stationary on c20 and c49-g on g16 (lnk_02); the 10:20 receipt passes lnk_05 at 2745.603 m and is counted. 1 packet in the 10:00 hour: dropped by lnk_04."
